---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { hrefFor, vocabLabel } from '../../lib/content';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
const items = (await getCollection('cases')).filter((c) => !c.data.draft);
---
<Base title="Evidence & practice" description="Traceable case studies of interventions in critical-minerals value chains, with evidence type, limitations and transfer conditions.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Evidence & tools', href: url('evidence/') }, { label: 'Practice' }]} />
    <header class="reading"><p class="kicker red-rule">Evidence & practice</p><h1>What has been tried, and what do we know?</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">Case studies record the intervention, the actors, the money, the mechanism and the evidence, and say clearly when a result is documented, plausible or still an untested hypothesis.</p></header>
    <ul class="record-list reading">
      {items.map((c) => <li><p class="kicker">{c.data.location} · {c.data.period}</p><h3><a href={hrefFor('cases', c.id)}>{c.data.title}</a></h3><p>{c.data.summary}</p><p class="meta"><span class="status">{vocabLabel('relationship', c.data.relationship)}</span> · {c.data.currentAsOf}</p></li>)}
    </ul>
    <section class="reading evidence evidence-unclear" aria-labelledby="need-h">
      <h2 id="need-h">Evidence we still need</h2>
      <ul>{items.flatMap((c) => c.data.unclear.map((u) => <li>{u} <span class="meta">(<a href={hrefFor('cases', c.id)}>{c.data.title}</a>)</span></li>))}</ul>
      <p>Three rules we apply when reading these gaps: the absence of an evaluation is not evidence of failure; an announced safeguard is not proof of benefit; and an organisation&rsquo;s mandate is not proof of delivery. Failed or mixed results are useful evidence, and we include them where they are documented.</p>
    </section>
    <div class="reading">
      <h2>Using the evidence</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={url('methodology/')}>How we assess evidence</a>: what counts as documented, plausible or hypothesis.</li>
        <li><a href={url('sources/')}>Source register</a>: every source with publication and retrieval dates.</li>
        <li><a href={url('updates/')}>Updates</a>: selected consequential developments, dated.</li>
        <li><a href={url('policies/')}>Policy records</a> and <a href={url('landscape/')}>organisations</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="meta">This release publishes {items.length} case studies. Further cases are held back until their sources can be verified.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
